{
    "title": "Linduu, and you?",
    "description": "Together instead of alone!\r\n\r\nMeet new people nearby using Linduu \u2013 your new favorite #1 social app\r\n\r\nAre you looking for new contacts, friendly conversations, or maybe a great love nearby? Do you want to have one social app that will equally help you find dates & meet new people? Then Linduu is the right friendship & dating app for you! Our 2 in 1 dating & meet new people app allows you not only to flirt and meet men or women, but also to start a chat to make new friends. Breaking the ice and searching for meaningful connections has become extremely easy!\r\n\r\n\u25ba SHAKE TO FIND AWESOME PEOPLE\r\n\r\nWhen it comes to meeting new people, there\u2019s no time to waste, right? Just open the app, shake your phone, and a new user profile will show up! You don\u2019t like it? No problem, shake it again and you\u2019ll see another one. The Shake feature is unlimited and allows you to find new users near you whenever you want! Use at your own risk ;)\r\n\r\n\u25ba FILTERS FOR AMAZING MATCHES\r\n\r\nFind what you want and need quicker with Linduu. Our app allows you to narrow your search per gender, online users, location (postcode), and age.\r\n\r\n\u25ba IGNITE A PASSION\r\n\r\nAre you feeling lonely and looking to mingle, chat & find dates? Linduu is your free dating app to find some nice people from your surroundings! Set them as favorites or write with them, exchange pictures, or arrange a date directly! Additionally, send friend requests, poke them, or send them gifts to get them interested. Ignite that passion and excitement all from your phone with Linduu.\r\n\r\n\u25ba FIND MEANINGFUL CONNECTIONS\r\n\r\nNot interested in dating and just want to meet new people who share your interests? Want to meet locals in a place where you live temporarily? As one of the best social media networks & hangout meets chat apps, Linduu is the perfect fit for that. Explore any location, chat, and meet with like-minded people. Check their profiles, see their interest in detail, and start connecting. Use Linduu as your easy answer to queries like \u201cMeet new people near me\u201d.\r\n\r\n\u25ba FIND A TRAVEL BUDDY\r\n\r\nPlanning a new road trip and need to find the perfect travel buddy? You can easily find the best travel mate that shares your interest with Linduu. Make your next adventure even more memorable and exciting.\r\n\r\n\u25ba EVERYTHING YOU NEED TO BOOST YOUR SOCIAL LIFE\r\n\r\nThe free social app for dating and meeting new people features an advanced matching platform, profiles with photos, and chat with emojis, and basically gives you everything important to boost your social life. Our friend finder and dating app also features notifications so you never miss a connection request or message.\r\n\r\nUse Linduu, the chat app for:\r\n\r\n\u25c9 dating, finding romance, passion, dates, and even true love\r\n\u25c9 making new friends and meeting new people in a certain location\r\n\u25c9 just chatting with random people\r\n\u25c9 finding travel mates for your travel adventures\r\n\r\n\u25ba REGISTER NOW\r\n\r\nRegister today on our fast meet app and become part of our unique community. Collect as many Linduu coins as possible by doing certain in-app actions and have nothing stopping you from finding the best new people in your life.\r\n\r\nLinduu welcomes all ages and nationalities! Because our motto is: Together instead of alone!\r\n\r\nDownload the fast meet, chat, flirt & social app for free!\r\n\r\n\u25ba 100% PRIVATE\r\n\r\nWorried about safety/privacy?\r\n\r\nHere at Linduu we have a zero-tolerance policy for any offensive behaviour. No user information is shared, sold, or rented to third parties. We promise you a private free chatting and dating app. It is a safe and private chat room for you to talk to people and make friends.\r\n\r\n\u25c6 Important\r\n\r\n- If you have any problem with this app, please contact us at app@justlin.net before rating, and we will help you resolve your issue.\r\n- Your feedback & suggestions are really important to us because they improve the overall experience of our free dating app.\r\n\r\n- Official website: linduu.us",
    "descriptionHTML": "Together instead of alone!<br><br>Meet new people nearby using Linduu \u2013 your new favorite #1 social app<br><br>Are you looking for new contacts, friendly conversations, or maybe a great love nearby? Do you want to have one social app that will equally help you find dates &amp; meet new people? Then Linduu is the right friendship &amp; dating app for you! Our 2 in 1 dating &amp; meet new people app allows you not only to flirt and meet men or women, but also to start a chat to make new friends. Breaking the ice and searching for meaningful connections has become extremely easy!<br><br>\u25ba SHAKE TO FIND AWESOME PEOPLE<br><br>When it comes to meeting new people, there\u2019s no time to waste, right? Just open the app, shake your phone, and a new user profile will show up! You don\u2019t like it? No problem, shake it again and you\u2019ll see another one. The Shake feature is unlimited and allows you to find new users near you whenever you want! Use at your own risk ;)<br><br>\u25ba FILTERS FOR AMAZING MATCHES<br><br>Find what you want and need quicker with Linduu. Our app allows you to narrow your search per gender, online users, location (postcode), and age.<br><br>\u25ba IGNITE A PASSION<br><br>Are you feeling lonely and looking to mingle, chat &amp; find dates? Linduu is your free dating app to find some nice people from your surroundings! Set them as favorites or write with them, exchange pictures, or arrange a date directly! Additionally, send friend requests, poke them, or send them gifts to get them interested. Ignite that passion and excitement all from your phone with Linduu.<br><br>\u25ba FIND MEANINGFUL CONNECTIONS<br><br>Not interested in dating and just want to meet new people who share your interests? Want to meet locals in a place where you live temporarily? As one of the best social media networks &amp; hangout meets chat apps, Linduu is the perfect fit for that. Explore any location, chat, and meet with like-minded people. Check their profiles, see their interest in detail, and start connecting. Use Linduu as your easy answer to queries like \u201cMeet new people near me\u201d.<br><br>\u25ba FIND A TRAVEL BUDDY<br><br>Planning a new road trip and need to find the perfect travel buddy? You can easily find the best travel mate that shares your interest with Linduu. Make your next adventure even more memorable and exciting.<br><br>\u25ba EVERYTHING YOU NEED TO BOOST YOUR SOCIAL LIFE<br><br>The free social app for dating and meeting new people features an advanced matching platform, profiles with photos, and chat with emojis, and basically gives you everything important to boost your social life. Our friend finder and dating app also features notifications so you never miss a connection request or message.<br><br>Use Linduu, the chat app for:<br><br>\u25c9 dating, finding romance, passion, dates, and even true love<br>\u25c9 making new friends and meeting new people in a certain location<br>\u25c9 just chatting with random people<br>\u25c9 finding travel mates for your travel adventures<br><br>\u25ba REGISTER NOW<br><br>Register today on our fast meet app and become part of our unique community. Collect as many Linduu coins as possible by doing certain in-app actions and have nothing stopping you from finding the best new people in your life.<br><br>Linduu welcomes all ages and nationalities! Because our motto is: Together instead of alone!<br><br>Download the fast meet, chat, flirt &amp; social app for free!<br><br>\u25ba 100% PRIVATE<br><br>Worried about safety/privacy?<br><br>Here at Linduu we have a zero-tolerance policy for any offensive behaviour. No user information is shared, sold, or rented to third parties. We promise you a private free chatting and dating app. It is a safe and private chat room for you to talk to people and make friends.<br><br>\u25c6 Important<br><br>- If you have any problem with this app, please contact us at app@justlin.net before rating, and we will help you resolve your issue.<br>- Your feedback &amp; suggestions are really important to us because they improve the overall experience of our free dating app.<br><br>- Official website: linduu.us",
